  "details": "# Issue:\n\nTurning on your camera drone and then switching back to the normal camera causes your camera indicator to disappear for others.\n\n** Reproduction Step:**\n\n1. Launch VRChat\n\n2. Join or invite a friend\n\n3. Turn on your normal camera (not sure if this part is required)\n\n4. Switch to the drone\n\n5. Switch back to your normal camera\n\nDoing this will make your camera indicator disappear for the other person. They can still see the name and the red maker when they open the Quick Menu, but the lens it self is gone.\n\n# Expected Behaviour:\n\nThe camera indicator should always be visible.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is an image showcasing the issue:",
